{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "action" %}
{# SeverActions Enterprises — the NPC labor market: this NPC's own job working
   for another NPC (npc_employer), or the workforce they employ themselves
   (npc_workforce). Both return "" when they don't apply. The player's
   retainers are retainer_status's surface — never this one. #}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% set npcJob = npc_employer(actorUUID) %}
{% if npcJob != "" %}
## Your Employment
You {{ npcJob }}.
- This is your ordinary living — speak of your work, your employer, and your pay as everyday facts of your life, not as anything unusual.
{% endif %}
{% set npcCrew = npc_workforce(actorUUID) %}
{% if npcCrew != "" %}
## Your Workforce
{{ npcCrew }} work for you.
- They are your employees — you pay their wages and their labor belongs to your business. You may speak of how they are working out, praise or grumble about them.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
